~ nav.wit — the sticky top bar. Exposed as #page_nav.

reference ./config.wit

#page_nav
@nav(class nav)
  @div(class wrap)
    @div(class nav-inner)
      @div(class logo) @span(class grad) Wit span@ div@
      @div(class nav-links)
        @a |href #features| Features a@
        @a |href #examples| Examples a@
        @a |href #why| Why Wit a@
        @a |href docs/index.html| Docs a@
        @gh_link |label GitHub|
        @div(class toggle) ◑ Dark div@
      div@
    div@
  div@
nav@
page_nav#
